<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueCopy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to copy a value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoValue *SilikoValueCopy(const SilikoValue *source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueCopy</function> function copies
<varname>source</varname> into a new <type>SilikoValue</type>
object.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoValueCopy</function> returns a pointer to the new
<type>SilikoValue</type> object if successful, <literal>NULL</literal>
otherwise.</para>
</refsection>
